  "title": "Root Beer Float Cake",
  "description": "This root beer cake recipe has good old-fashioned flavor. The kids will love it. You can sprinkle crushed root beer candies over the top. This cake is best served with vanilla ice cream.",
  "authors": [
    "Karin Christian"
  ],
